      "value": "Duplicate of:\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/make-collab-group-tool-happen\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/colab-groups-plus-choose-more-than-one-group\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/allow-groups-to-link-instances-to-other-group-instances\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/collab-groups\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/collab-group-instances\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/group-collaboration-instance\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/vrchat-group-collabs\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/group-collabs\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/collab-partner-group\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/linking-groups-together-when-doing-collab-events-in-vrchat-groups\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/mult-group-multi-group-instances\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/ability-for-multiple-groups-to-promote-a-single-lobby",
